# Translation files merge key by key (tools/merge_i18n.py), and files tools/sync.py makes keep our side, to be
# rebuilt. Both need turning on once in your clone:  python tools/merge_i18n.py --install
# Everything tools/sync.py rebuilds is also marked linguist-generated (#456), so GitHub folds it away in a
# pull request instead of showing ~20 MB of generated file.
i18n/*.json merge=i18n
lang/*.js merge=generated linguist-generated
python/runtime.py merge=generated linguist-generated
docs/words/*.md merge=generated linguist-generated
web/fonts/*.woff2 binary
